{"seq":2,"slug":"decorator-nodes","title":"装饰节点：修改行为语义","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-ai-behavior-trees/node-types/decorator-nodes","wordCount":632,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"装饰节点-修改行为语义\">装饰节点：修改行为语义</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>装饰节点（Decorator Node）是 BT 中的<strong>行为修改器</strong>——它包裹单个子节点，拦截其返回值或控制其执行方式，从而改变原始行为的语义。装饰节点是 BT 可组合性的重要来源：不需要修改叶节点实现就能改变其行为。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    D[装饰节点] --&gt; I[Inverter\\n取反]&#10;    D --&gt; R[Repeater\\n重复执行]&#10;    D --&gt; C[Cooldown\\n冷却限制]&#10;    D --&gt; F[ForceSuccess\\n强制成功]&#10;    D --&gt; T[TimeLimit\\n时间限制]&#10;    I --&gt; I1[SUCCESS ↔ FAILURE 互换]&#10;    R --&gt; R1[循环 N 次 / 无限循环]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[冷却时间内返回 FAILURE]&#10;    F --&gt; F1[FAILURE → SUCCESS\\n不影响 RUNNING]&#10;    T --&gt; T1[超时 → FAILURE\\n并中止子节点]\">graph TD\n    D[装饰节点] --&gt; I[Inverter\\n取反]\n    D --&gt; R[Repeater\\n重复执行]\n    D --&gt; C[Cooldown\\n冷却限制]\n    D --&gt; F[ForceSuccess\\n强制成功]\n    D --&gt; T[TimeLimit\\n时间限制]\n    I --&gt; I1[SUCCESS ↔ FAILURE 互换]\n    R --&gt; R1[循环 N 次 / 无限循环]\n    C --&gt; C1[冷却时间内返回 FAILURE]\n    F --&gt; F1[FAILURE → SUCCESS\\n不影响 RUNNING]\n    T --&gt; T1[超时 → FAILURE\\n并中止子节点]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>装饰节点</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n<th>返回值修改</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Inverter</td>\n<td>反转条件语义</td>\n<td>SUCCESS↔FAILURE</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Repeater</td>\n<td>循环执行行为</td>\n<td>按配置决定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cooldown</td>\n<td>限制行为频率</td>\n<td>冷却中返回 FAILURE</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ForceSuccess</td>\n<td>使可选行为不阻塞</td>\n<td>FAILURE→SUCCESS</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TimeLimit</td>\n<td>防止行为无限 RUNNING</td>\n<td>超时返回 FAILURE</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>UntilSuccess</td>\n<td>重复直到成功</td>\n<td>成功时 SUCCESS</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>UntilFail</td>\n<td>重复直到失败</td>\n<td>失败时 SUCCESS</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"inverter-条件取反\">Inverter：条件取反</h2><p>Inverter 是最简单也最常用的装饰节点，将子节点的 SUCCESS 和 FAILURE 互换，RUNNING 不变：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"class InverterDecorator implements DecoratorNode {&#10;  constructor(private readonly child: BTNode) {}&#10;&#10;  tick(blackboard: Blackboard): NodeStatus {&#10;    const status = this.child.tick(blackboard);&#10;    switch (status) {&#10;      case NodeStatus.SUCCESS:&#10;        return NodeStatus.FAILURE;&#10;      case NodeStatus.FAILURE:&#10;        return NodeStatus.SUCCESS;&#10;      case NodeStatus.RUNNING:&#10;        return NodeStatus.RUNNING;&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> InverterDecorator</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> implements</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DecoratorNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  constructor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">private</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> child</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> BTNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  tick</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">blackboard</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Blackboard</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> NodeStatus</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.child.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">tick</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(blackboard);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    switch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (status) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      case</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> NodeStatus.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SUCCESS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> NodeStatus.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">FAILURE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      case</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> NodeStatus.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">FAILURE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> NodeStatus.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SUCCESS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      case</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> NodeStatus.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">RUNNING</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> NodeStatus.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">RUNNING</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>典型用途</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"Sequence [在非战斗状态下巡逻]&#10;  ├── Inverter&#10;  │     └── Condition: IsEnemyVisible  ← 取反：「没有看到敌人」&#10;  └── Action: Patrol\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Sequence [在非战斗状态下巡逻]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ├── Inverter</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  │     └── Condition: IsEnemyVisible  ← 取反：「没有看到敌人」</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  └── Action: Patrol</span></span></code></pre></div><p>没有 Inverter，条件节点只能表达「满足则 SUCCESS」。Inverter 让所有 Condition 节点同时具备正向和反向语义，无需为每个条件写两个节点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"repeater-循环执行\">Repeater：循环执行</h2><p>Repeater 重复执行子节点，常用于需要持续循环的行为：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"class RepeaterDecorator implements DecoratorNode {&#10;  private count = 0;&#10;&#10;  constructor(&#10;    private readonly child: BTNode,&#10;    private readonly maxCount: number = -1, // -1 表示无限循环&#10;  ) {}&#10;&#10;  tick(blackboard: Blackboard): NodeStatus {&#10;    const status = this.child.tick(blackboard);&#10;&#10;    if (status === NodeStatus.RUNNING) {&#10;      return NodeStatus.RUNNING;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    // 子节点完成（SUCCESS 或 FAILURE）&#10;    this.count++;&#10;&#10;    if (this.maxCount !== -1 &amp;&amp; this.count &gt;= this.maxCount) {&#10;      this.count = 0;&#10;      return NodeStatus.SUCCESS; // 完成指定次数&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    // 重置子节点，下帧继续循环&#10;    this.child.reset?.();&#10;    return NodeStatus.RUNNING;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  onAbort(): void {&#10;    this.child.onAbort?.();&#10;    this.count = 0;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> RepeaterDecorator</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> implements</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DecoratorNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  private</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> count</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  constructor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    private</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> child</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> BTNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    private</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> maxCount</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// -1 表示无限循环</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ) {}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  tick</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">blackboard</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Blackboard</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> NodeStatus</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.child.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">tick</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(blackboard);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (status </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> NodeStatus.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">RUNNING</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> NodeStatus.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">RUNNING</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 子节点完成（SUCCESS 或 FAILURE）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.count</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.maxCount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!==</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--